Charisma
Charisma - Last Edited: 2014-07-25 18:10:54 by lohrr
====================================================
Charisma is a combination of both appearance and force of personality. High
charisma is the mark of leaders and persuaders of all types. Charisma is
one of the major attributes for Paladins and Conjurers.
A high charisma also has a calming effect on aggressive monsters, allowing you
to pass by them if you are fast enough.
