Command aura
Command aura - Last Edited: 2007-10-30 17:53:25 by zion
=======================================================
Command Aura is a passive skill given to Avengers and Dreadlords that grants
benefits to the entire group.  For this to be applied the player must be the
leader of the group.  By joining the group, Command Aura will become active
immediately. Command aura grants the group a hitroll/damroll increase dependent
on the Avenger or Dreadlord's level, but also grants several other abilities,
depending on the class/spec of the character. They are outlined below.
Avenger
Regeneration
Avenger Specs:
Lightbringer
Higher AC
Inquisitor
Higher CON
Dreadlord
Additional Save Fear
Dreadlord Specs:
Deathlord
Higher STR
Shadowlord
Higher AGI
==See also==
avenger, dreadlord, innate, aura

#0

Elemental Aura
Elemental Aura - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
============================================================
* Area of effect: <caster>
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Dependent on proficiency of caster
* Type of spell:  Generic
When cast in a Fire, Water, Air, or Earth Plane room, this spell allows the
Druid to temporarily possess some properties of that plane. The specific
properties vary from plane to plane, although rumors tell that most planes
possess statistical elements and many others. There is also a chance that the
caster will achieve FULL elemental form, infusing them with added powers.

An existing elemental aura from this spell, another aura spell, equipment,
race, or form prevents a second elemental aura. A rejected cast does not
consume mana or a prepared spell.

