Mana
Mana - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:13 by Unknown
==================================================
The Psionicist class uses the mana system (rather than the memorize system).  What this means is rather than praying or memorizing for spell slots, each spell takes a specific number of mana to cast.  If the caster runs out of mana, or exceeds him/herself when casting a spell, he/she will pass out for a short period of time.
==See also==
* Psionicist

