#0

Dharma
Dharma - Last Edited: 2015-07-13 20:00:09 by lohrr
==================================================
* Area of effect: <self>
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Dependent on devotion proficiency
* Type of spell:  Protection
Paladins were granted an unusual holy spell to combat certain
opponents. Dharma scatters the paladin's soul into limbo so it may
brush up against the positive plane of existence. The paladin's soul
requires protection otherwise dharma will falter and fade.
When the paladin is in a melee and their opponent has somehow surpassed
their regular lifeforce, the energies of the positive plane will transfer
some of lifeforce to the paladin, which causes the paladin to experience
exuberant righteousness.
Devotion is a vital aspect as it increases dharma's duration and
effectiveness. Dharma provides some protection and healing abilities
only if the paladin is receiving a transfer of lifeforce and their
devotion exceeds certain thresholds.
This spell will only show on score if those affected have detect magic up.
==See also==
* Paladin
* Soulshield

