Accuse
Accuse - Last Edited: 2008-03-14 19:19:15 by Blaize
===================================================
Accuse is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you
to Accuse, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands
will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are
sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to
express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Accuse = You want to accuse someone of something!
Accuse me/self = You accuse yourself.
Accuse (target name) = You look accusingly at(target name)
==See also==
Emote
Social Actions

