Attributes
Attributes - Last Edited: 2009-03-10 19:13:49 by Blaize
=======================================================
Attributes of a character on Duris are most likely more vital than anything else.
There are currently 9 main Attributes.
*Strength    : Increases damroll when over max.
*Agility     : Important for battle maneuvers such as dodge and avoiding knock down skills.
*Dexterity   : Important for many skills such as trip, bash and parry.
*Constitution: The main attribute for the hitpoints of a character.
*Luck        : Raises the amount of random drops and critical hits.
*Power       : Primary stat for classes that use Psionics and Power spells.
*Wisdom      : Determines the time it takes for Priest types to pray their spells.
*Intelligence: Determines the time it takes for Mystics to memorize their spells.
*Charisma    : Important for controlling NPC followers.
One attribute hidden in mystery.
*Karma
==See Also==
* Agility
* Charisma
* Constitution
* Dexterity
* Dexterity (spell)
* Enhance Dexterity
* Intelligence
* Luck
* Power
* Strength
* Wisdom

