Auction Bid
Auction Bid - Last Edited: 2015-07-09 16:41:27 by lohrr
=======================================================
Auc Bid is used to bid on the items you chose to bid on from the list.
You must do 2 things to bid on items:
* have the coins in your inventory
* be at the auction house.
General Usage:
  auc bid <item id> <amount in platinum>
To bid 300 platinum on item number 21, one would type:
  auc bid 21 300
The global auctioning committee has deemed it as against the interest
of the system to allow 'bid sniping' and has decreed that bidding late
in an auction will extend the auction term, unless using
he buy-it-now function.
==See also==
* Auction

