Auction Offer
Auction Offer - Last Edited: 2017-09-19 00:44:29 by lohrr
=========================================================
Use this command at the Auction houses to sell your fine equipment to others.
Auctioning an item requires a few things:
* an item to be auctioned, and it must be in your inventory
* a few platinum on hand as the auction service charge
* some time to wait for someone to buy your item
As the person setting up the auction, you may specify (but are not required to) any of these:
* starting bid price (in platinum)
* buy it now price (in platinum)
* auction length (in days)
* number of items to auction (1 to 9)
General usage:
  auction offer <item> [start price] [buy-it-now price] [duration] [quantity]
For example, if you wanted to auction a steel sword you could it multiple ways:
* To auction the sword for 10 plat with the standard 2 day timer:
  auc offer sword 10
* To auction the sword for 10 plat with the standard 2 day timer, or someone can buy it now for 50 plat:
  auc offer sword 10 50
* To auction the sword for 10 plat with a 4 day timer, or someone can buy it now for 50 plat:
  auc offer sword 10 50 4
* To auction 5 of the sword for 10 plat with a 4 day timer, or someone can buy it now for 50 plat
  auc offer sword 10 50 4 5
Note: You must actually have 5 of the same sword in your inventory to auction them as a bundle.
This is more useful for cheaper items such as potions.
==See Also==
Auction

