#0

Auction
Auction - Last Edited: 2015-07-09 17:05:20 by lohrr
===================================================
Players can access the auction services from generally anywhere they
find themselves in the world of Duris. Auctions are an amazing way to
acquire high level equipment with minimal effort.
The global auctioning committee has worked long and arduously
coordinating Human, Halfling, Orc, and Duergar Dwarf
efforts to allow this civilized form of bartering. In order to maximize
the market, the committee has magically interconnected all auction houses
allowing even the shadiest Duergar Dwarf to sell to the most righteous
paladin and vice versa.
The global auctioning committee has created magical portals that allow
you to use the auction commands from anywhere in the game, granted
you haven't recently engaged in PvP.
Additionally, there are many auction houses throughout the world where
players can use the auction services at any time.
Currently they are located in:
* Tharnadia: Tharnadian Auction House
* Woodseer: Vendurini's Auction House
* Winterhaven: The Auction House
* Shady Grove: Auction Mound
Auction commands can be abbreviated to one letter (for example: instead
of "auction list sort head" you can type "auc l s head")
The currently available commands at auction houses are:
* auction list: see what is available at the auction
* auction offer: offer something to be sold at auction
* auction bid: place a bid
* auction info: find out stats on an item that is up for auction
* auction pickup: pickup items or cash from the auction house
These commands are available at any time, except for a short period after
removing a worn piece of equipment.

