Avarne
Avarne - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:09 by Unknown
====================================================
Avarne is a forest country that lies in the easternly part of the KK continent.  Within Avarne's forest are many creatures such as the tor, treant, and bandit swashbuckers.  These are excellent for hunting.  Deeper inside Avarne lies a community of Thri-Kreens, one of which is rumored to keep track of the artifacts in the lands of Duris.  There are two sets of temples, one belonging to those of the Star Worshippers, and the other belonging to the Sun Worshippers.  Little is known about the Castle of Avarne, except there is rumored to be a quest for the Kings blade of Aravne, requiring 13 heads of various leaders in Avarne country.
==See also==
zones, KK, thri-kreen, exp, artifacts

#0

Avatar
Avatar - Last Edited: 2008-04-02 17:48:03 by Blaize
===================================================
An avatar is created by the spell "channel", which requires four clerics
over level 50 to create. All four clerics begin casting the spell until the
avatar appears. It is then led by the lead cleric while the other three
clerics can only watch. The avatar itself is a level 56 cleric/warrior mob,
capable of all the spells and skills of those classes. The four clerics
themselves are left in a state of sleep until the avatar is lost or dies,
and their actual bodies are in no danger if the avatar is attacked.
Warning: If ANY one of the clerics that created the avatar loses link, the
avatar will be lost.
==See also==
* Channel

