Ayt - Last Edited: 2008-03-31 18:01:25 by Blaize
================================================
Ayt is short for Are You There? Ayt is a social command, or an
Emote. Typing this command will allow you to ask someone if they
are really there using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of
using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long
phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More
often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The
command list is as follows.
Ayt = Is WHO there?
Ayt me/self = You wonder if your really here.
Ayt (target name) = You wave your hands in (target name) face,
wondering if it's really there.
