#0

Bandage
Bandage - Last Edited: 2008-04-02 17:52:34 by Blaize
====================================================
Bandages can now be purchased the world over. If standing still, not fighting or
hiding, you can bandage yourself up to near your total health, the full amount
depends upon the type of bandage. The higher your skill the better you apply the
bandage and the faster you heal. It is possible to destroy the bandage while the
skill is low.  There are three styles: a gauze bandage, a gauze tourniquet and a
large medicated bandage. The most expensive bandage can recover twice as much as
the next and five times as much as the cheapest. You may bandage your own wounds
once every three mud hours.
==See also==
* Hitpoints
* Old Bandage

