Bang - Last Edited: 2008-04-02 18:09:19 by Blaize
=================================================
Bang is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you
to Bang a head, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these
commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social
commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple
command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Bang = OUCH! A head like that should hurt.
Bang me/self = You shoot your self in the head.
