Bearhug
Bearhug - Last Edited: 2011-03-31 01:03:37 by Jexni
===================================================
Syntax:	bearhug <victim>
Available to the Mercenary, this skill involves wrapping one's arms
around the victim and attempting to squeeze the air out of their
lungs. A successful bearhug will result in the victim being unable
to do much for a short period, will inflict some damage, and will
also prime the victim for additional attacks.  Strength is a major
component in this skill, both for the attacker and victim.
