Blademaster
Blademaster - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Blademaster is a Ranger specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+gCen&+Ltaur&n, &+WGith&+Gzerai&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+yHalfling&n, &+CHuman&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Class mechanics==
Blademasters receive a 10% bonus to the defensive parry value and a 5% bonus
to the standard riposte value used in combat checks. Training caps are
unchanged, and normal skill, weapon, and combat conditions still apply.
