Board
Board - Last Edited: 2008-04-02 19:38:38 by Blaize
==================================================
Boards can be found in a few different locations.  The most
common place one can find a board would be in a Guild Hall.
Some hometowns also have a board where players can post a
message.  One can view the board to see the different messages
posted and by whom.
Examples:
Look board - allows you to view the posts on the board.
Read <post number> - allows you to read a specific post.
write <title> - allows you to write on the board and name your
post
delete <post number> - deletes a specified post.  This only
works if you wrote the post or if you are a higher rank in
the guild.
When writing be sure to use /s to save your post.
==See also==
* Guild
* Guildhall

