Braddistock manor
Braddistock manor - Last Edited: 2008-01-11 02:34:20 by Kharne
==============================================================
Levels: 35-50<br>
<br>
Abandoned for centuries, Braddistock Manor has long been a top notch first adventure for an explorer new to the world of Duris.  Since then, however, it's become infested with rats unlike which have ever seen before.  Lord Braddistock now lets anyone who wishes enter the mansion, in hopes they will cure his "rat problem."  Inexperienced adventurers are no match for the man-eating swarms inside, and there are even rumors of "ratmen" existing in the basement...
==History==
In times passed the lower reaches of this Mansion housed a unique necklace of much agility. Sadly, this has been removed from the game.
==See also==
zones, exp, Tharnadia

