Swashbuckler
Swashbuckler - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Swashbuckler is a Warrior specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+mDrow Elf&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+CHuman&n, &+LOrc&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Class mechanics==
Swashbucklers receive a 10% bonus to both the defensive parry value and the
standard riposte value used in combat checks. Their attacks are also harder
to parry: the attacker's value in the defender's parry check is increased by
10%. Training caps are unchanged, and normal skill, weapon, and combat
conditions still apply.
==Skill changes==
&+b1st Level: &+cawareness (cap 80%), retreat (cap 100%)&n
&+b30th Level: &+cdual wield (cap 100%), legsweep (cap 100%),&n
    &+cswitch opponents (cap 100%)&n
&+b36th Level: &+cquick step (cap 100%)&n
&+b41st Level: &+cevade (cap 25%), sneak (cap 60%), triple attack (cap 90%)&n
&+b56th Level: &+cvicious attack (cap 100%)&n
1h bludgeon: no grant in this specialization
1h flaying: no grant in this specialization
2h bludgeon: no grant in this specialization
2h flaying: no grant in this specialization
2h slashing: no grant in this specialization
bash: no grant in this specialization
berserk: no grant in this specialization
guard: no grant in this specialization
reach weapons: no grant in this specialization
shield block: no grant in this specialization
==Spell changes==
None beyond the base-class registrations.
==Innate additions==
*&+crapier and dirk&n
*&+cseadog&n (obtained at level &+c30&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Warrior
* Warrior Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

