Brief Mode
Brief Mode - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
========================================================
Brief mode is a toggleable feature that can help reduce the amount
of information you see on your screen.  When brief mode is toggled,
you will not see long room descriptions or full exit directions.
Instead of seeing north, south, east and west, it will just display
as N, S, E, W.  While this toggle may help you reduce spam, it
can also make you miss important hints given in room long descriptions.
Syntax:  Tog brief
==See also==
Toggle

