Bullywug Village
Bullywug Village - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
==============================================================
==Characteristics==
* Levels: 10-20
==Description==
Located on the north edge of the Rift Valley Jungle, the Bullywug Village is an excellent place for a new Duris adventurer to find some much needed experience.  Bullywugs, humanoid frogs, are social creatures that have established a thriving village feeding off the resources of the Rift Valley Jungle.  Their evil nature makes their village a prime hunting ground for righteous Paladins and virtuous Rangers.  But, beware their hardy hunters, fearsome warriors, and powerful shamans... especially when guards are near.  The Rift Valley Jungle is no place for the feint of heart and the Bullywugs have managed to not only survive but thrive on its fringes.  A Highlord Guardian limits access to the village making it a safe haven against higher level foes.<br>
<br>
*Quest: Yes
==See also==
Woodseer, Lizardmen, Rift Valley Jungle, exp, Highlord Guardian

