Cavalier
Cavalier - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Cavalier is a Paladin specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+WGith&+Gzerai&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+CHuman&n, &+YDwarf&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Class mechanics==
Cavaliers can guard two people at once under the checked-in multi-guard limit. Guard still requires an eligible nearby target and the ordinary guard skill; server properties can change the simultaneous-target limit.
==Skill changes==
&+b30th Level: &+csidestep (cap 100%)&n
&+b41st Level: &+clance charge (cap 100%)&n
==Spell changes==
&+b10th Circle: &+choly sacrifice&n
==Innate additions==
*&+cknight&n (obtained at level &+c30&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Paladin
* Paladin Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

