Class
Class - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Choose a class from the menu offered for the selected race. Race, alignment,
and server settings determine creation eligibility.
==Normal creation classes==
Warrior, Ranger, Psionicist, Paladin, Anti-Paladin, Cleric, Monk, Druid, Shaman, Sorcerer, Necromancer, Conjurer, Rogue, Mercenary, Bard, Berserker, Reaver, Illusionist, Blighter, Ethermancer, Summoner.

Dragoon is disabled in the checked-in policy. Standalone Assassin, Thief,
Warlock, MindFlayer, Alchemist, Dreadlord, Avenger, and Theurgist have no
normal-roster creation combination. Assassin and Thief are normally Rogue
specializations. Special event settings can expose additional choices.
