Conjure elemental
Conjure elemental - Last Edited: 2013-04-17 21:47:56 by targ
============================================================
* Area of effect: One elemental
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Instantaneous
* Type of spell:  Summoning
When cast, "Conjure Elemental" summons an elemental from a random elemental
plane which will follow the player as though charmed for a limited period
of time. There is no way to control which type of elemental is summoned, but
specialized conjurers will always conjure elementals of their chosen specialization.
A character or mobile may have no more than three elemental followers at any
time.
If the elemental is aggressive when the charm wears off, it will attack you
and others.
==See also==
Conjure Greater Elemental

