Star Magus
Star Magus - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Star Magus is a Ethermancer specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+mDrow Elf&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n, &+WGith&+Gzerai&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+yHalfling&n, &+CHuman&n, &+LKobold&n,
  &+LOrc&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Skill changes==
None beyond the base-class registrations.
==Spell changes==
&+b6th Circle: &+cnegative energy barrier&n
&+b7th Circle: &+ccomet, conjure void, cosmic vacuum&n
&+b8th Circle: &+cethereal discharge, negative feedback barrier, wall of iron&n
&+b9th Circle: &+cantimatter collision, planetary alignment&n
&+b10th Circle: &+csolar flare&n
&+b11th Circle: &+csupernova&n
&+b12th Circle: &+ccosmic rift&n
==Innate additions==
None beyond the base-class registrations.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Ethermancer
* Ethermancer Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

