Creeping doom
Creeping doom - Last Edited: 2010-08-08 18:36:39 by kitsero
===========================================================
* Area of effect: room
* Aggressive:     Yes
* Cumulative:     Yes
* Duration:       4 to 6 waves
* Type of spell:  Generic
This deadly spell summons millions of arachnids to overrun the druid's
enemies in wave upon wave of insects, all biting their victim at once.
The onslaught of insect bites results in significant damage to the
victims.
The caster should use favorable terrain. Forest, swamps and the underdark
are places where the the caster can easily summon hordes of biting and
stinging bugs.
Forest druid are by far the best practitioners of the creeping doom spell.
These druids have the ability to bring forth more insects than another
other caster.
