#0

Damroll
Damroll - Last Edited: 2007-09-27 04:10:03 by Jexni
===================================================
Damroll is one of the things that affect how much damage you will inflict on
your vicitim.  Damroll only applies to physical damage from melee combat and
not to other forms of damage.  Other things that affect the damage you inflict
are the dice of your weapon, your skills and some spells.  After level 25,
your damroll will be displayed in numbers.  There are many ways to raise your
damroll; equipment and spells alike can grant you power reflected in your
damroll amount.  The attribute Strength will also raise your damroll, so
make sure it is high if you want to do more damage to your foes.
==See also==
Hitroll, Attributes, Strength, Fighter

