#0

Desolate
Desolate - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:10 by Unknown
======================================================
Desolate is a quaint forest town located not far
from the searing desert sands and the Savannah of sorrow.
The road leading up to the town is patrolled by many
militia guards who watch for evil invaders. The town
itself has a ban on using magic in an attempt to prevent
conflicts and disasters. Perhaps one of the redeeming
qualities of this prohibitive town is the existence of a
bank to make deposits and withdrawls as well as as inn.
For players, Desolate offers a wide range of mobs on which
to gain experience for most levels as well as an
assortment of mid to high-level equipment and quests.
It is known that the Army of Armageddon has encamped
at the beach and does not trust players of good alignment.
They have also attempted to attack and invade Desolate in
the past, and players should watch out for signs of the
dark army's return, as it can turn the peaceful little
township into a vicious and dangerous warground even for
the experienced.
==See also==
Savannah of sorrow, Army of Armageddon, zones, exp, credits

