Detonate
Detonate - Last Edited: 2009-06-12 19:03:04 by Blaize
=====================================================
Updated: 12Jun09
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Dependent on proficiency of caster
* Type of spell:  PSI
Detonate is a very powerful psionic spell. Developed by mind flayers, the spell
uses the powers of the mind to cause particles within the victims to explode,
causing a great deal of pain. The spell is very aggressive but does not have a
cumulative effect. When being used against constructs and pets, the spell does
significantly more damage.
The pyrokinetic specialization has advanced this spell to suit their purpose.
Their version of detonate does PSI and fire damage. The improved version is
so effective that the spell cannot be shrugged. The pyrokinetic detonate does
less damage than normal.
==See also==
* Psionicist
* Spells

