Diabolis - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Diabolis is a Necromancer specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+mDri&+Lder&n, &+mDrow Elf&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n, &+WGith&+Gzerai&n, &+RGnome&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+CHuman&n, &+LKobold&n, &+LL&+mic&+Lh&n,
  &+LOrc&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Skill changes==
&+b30th Level: &+cexhume (cap 100%)&n
==Spell changes==
&+b4th Circle: &+cunmaking&n
&+b8th Circle: &+cdestroy undead&n
&+b9th Circle: &+ccreate golem&n
==Innate additions==
*&+cmummify&n (obtained at level &+c41&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Necromancer
* Necromancer Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

