Disguise
Disguise - Last Edited: 2015-01-05 18:20:16 by ashyel
=====================================================
Through a combination of proper equipment and skill a player may disguise his appearance from others, appearing as a mob or even another player. In order to do this, players need to purchase disguise kits at one of a few vendors throughout the realm.
The command to use these kits is to type 'disguise <intended disguise> while holding a  kit in your inventory.  To reverse the disguise and appear as yourself again, simply type 'disguise'.   A new kit will be required for each attempt to disguise, as it will be destroyed upon returning to your natural shape.
Stay aware of the condition of your kit by checking score.  Battle and time will wear down your disguise until eventually it fails and you are back to being yourself.   Also please note: Until you have obtained sufficiently high skill level in disguising, you are at risk of failing your attempt at it, destroying the kit and retaining your natural shape.

