Divine Home
Divine Home - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
=========================================================
The Divine Home, or Home of the Divine is a quasi-plane
and cloudscape that is inhabited by angels, angelkin and
titans. The Home is protected by Leolan, the prince of the titans who watches over the area from within the Halls of Judgement.
For players the Home of Divine offers little in the way
of experience, however many valuable objects can be
found here, including a multitude of random and rare load
objects. There are only a few small aggressive areas so
exploration of the cloudscape is usually safe.
==See also==
zones, credits, exp

