Docks
Docks - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
Across Duris are many sets of docks where ships can land to.  These docks are often found in trading or commercial zones.  A dock may be noticed on the map by a docked ship marked as S.  These ships are specific to the person who owns it and cannot be sailed by anyone else, unless they are in the group of the ship owner.  To purchase a ship, one can be done so at most commercial docks, and the docks north of Tharnadia.  It requires 100 platinum to start out, and refunds are given, however only at 3/4 the price.
==See also==
ship, sailing

