Doomlure
Doomlure - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:11 by Unknown
======================================================
To doomlure or immolure is to cause a mob to chase after you by way of wave-type spells. This tactic is used often when mobs are grouped together making it foolish and impractical to rush in.
A tank or pet is sent forward first, then the lurer enters, casts, and runs. A few words of warning, this tactic does not always work the first time. Problems arise then the tank does not flee soon enough, the pet lasts past the end of the spell, or the mob shrugged the spell. It is also noteworthy that mobs able to range their magic have been known to require the lurer to run farther or turn corners in order to lure properly.
==See also==
Creeping Doom, Dread Wave, Immolate, Immolure, Bleed

