Dream
Dream - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
Dream is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Dream nice dreams, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Dream = You look into the sky and fall into a dream.
Dream me/self = You dream about your self!
Dream (target name) = You stare off into open space, dreaming about (target name)
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

#0

Dream Travel
Dream Travel - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
==========================================================
* Area of effect: Caster and player(s)
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Instantaneous
* Type of spell:  Teleportation
The spell dream travel is a VERY powerful teleportation type spell. Casting
this spell on a player causes the caster to fall asleep and dream of his
destination and when the caster wakes up he has arrived in most cases at
whom he dreamed of. If the caster casts this spell on themselves every
one in their group not in combat that has consented the caster will
fall into a deep sleep causing them to dream of the caster and after
wakening they will be in the same room as the caster.
Syntax: cast "dream travel" playername -to travel to any player on your side of the race wars.
Syntax:	cast "dream travel" self or me -to cause all consented group members to travel to your location.

