Fly is required if you wish to move on this plane. Many winter wolves, powerful djinns and air elementals, to name just a few, roam this plane. Yet, Something else is out there as well. Scanning will help you locate and avoid this menance; engaging him prior to clearing the plane will result in a legendary battle or a bloody slaughter. It is also rumored that a path leads to Bahamut's.
