Elemental Plane of Earth
Elemental Plane of Earth - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
======================================================================
Earth treants well versed in shamanic ways, huge Golems of stone, and Xorns conjuring trouble have made their home here. The master of this plane lies in wait hidden, ready to call for help to destroy anyone foolish enough to oppose him. Rumors have told of a pair of gauntlets that come from this plane: one pair dusty from the earthquakes it causes and another pair encased in stone, much like the person who wears them.
==See also==
zones, credits

