Elemental Plane of Water
Elemental Plane of Water - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
======================================================================
Eyes of the deep and whales have made their home here and protect it viciously. Rumors of a great kingdom and a palace lead this this plane, as does the shrill wail of the banshee residing in the orb of the sea.
==See also==
Elemental Plane of Fire, Elemental Plane of Earth, Elemental Plane of Air

