Elementalist
Elementalist - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Elementalist is a Shaman specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+BBarbarian&n, &+gCen&+Ltaur&n, &+mDrow Elf&n, &+yFir&+cbolg&n, &+RGnome&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+yHalfling&n,
  &+CHuman&n, &+LKobold&n, &+LMino&+rtaur&n, &+bOgre&n, &+LOrc&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n, &+gTroll&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Skill changes==
None beyond the base-class registrations.
==Spell changes==
&+b7th Circle: &+celemental affinity&n
&+b9th Circle: &+cwind tunnel&n
&+b11th Circle: &+cbinding wind, cascading elemental beam, nivards wicked firebrand&n
&+b12th Circle: &+celemental fury, guardian spirits&n
==Innate additions==
*&+celemental power&n (obtained at level &+c35&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Shaman
* Shaman Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

