#0

Encrust
Encrust - Last Edited: 2015-05-18 01:53:30 by lohrr
===================================================
Encrusting is one of the highly sought after Epic skills of the Alchemy.
By collecting various rare gems, the user can bind into other
equipment items the power of these stones.
The stones themselves can sometimes be found in the corpses of the more
fearsome and hard to kill creatures of Duris.
You will need to make sure that the equipment item and the stone you wish
to use for the "encrust" are both in your inventory then type:
     encrust item stone
For example if you have "a strange Green stone", and "a steel dagger", just
make sure both are in your inventory then type: encrust dagger stone
Warning: Encrusting an item, overwrites all existing procedures for that item.
This powerful ability is taught by the vagabond alchemist in the
Divine Home.
You cannot encrust an artifact.
NOTE: To learn this epic skill, one must first master the epic skill of Craft

