Energy Drain
Energy Drain - Last Edited: 2015-07-16 00:53:27 by ashyel
=========================================================
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive:     Yes
* Cumulative:     Yes
* Duration:       Permanent
* Type of spell:  Negative
"Energy Drain" literally drains the lifeblood from the victim, as it feeds
on the energy for itself. Although it does not do much damage to the
victim, a successful spell cast causes the victim to lose energy, and the
caster  to gain life force, movement points, and mana.
The gods consider such an act upon another living being extremely evil and
casting this spell will cause a player to become more and more evil aligned.
