#0

Epic
Epic - Last Edited: 2015-09-18 16:37:13 by lohrr
================================================
You can earn Epic Points at any level, from runestones and monoliths,
enemy kills and other epic rewards. Epic potions can be quaffed at any
level and award 75 points each.

Use 'score' to see your balance, total earned points and current epic task.
The Gods may assign a task as you earn points. Until it is complete, some
further awards are reduced. Epic potions do not count toward assigning tasks.
Epic skill training begins at level 30, with each skill's usual class,
prerequisite, epic-point and platinum requirements. Use 'epic skills' to
find teachers. Epic points are spent directly; separate skill points are
no longer used.

The epics needed to progress past level 50 are as follows...
* 51:  1000 + touch Charcoal Palace, The Great Shaboath, or Lost Temple of Tikitzopl
* 52:  2500 + touch Plane of Fire-Brass, Githzerai Stronghold or Temple of Earth.
* 53:  4500 + touch Ceothia or Tiamat
* 54:  7000 + touch Bahamut's Palace, Apocalypse Castle or Vecna's tomb
* 55: 10000 + touch Negative Material Plane or Bronze Citadel
* 56: 13500 + touch Celestial Plane, Castle Ravenloft, Ny'Neth Stronghold Continued or
   The 222nd Layer of the Abyss
You can gain these epic points from either finding and touching the many runestones and monoliths hidden about the land, or by tasting the blood of your enemies.
From level 51 onwards, you must seek out a specific stone (listed above)  and touch it to receive the level.  You may also level by accruing 2x the required amount of epics, then touching any stone.  The cost to you will remain the same. You will not be charged double epics for touching a runestone that is not specific to your level.
**Multi-classes no longer need double epics to level.**
==See also==
* Monoliths
* Skills
* Runestone

Divine Boons can increase eligible rewards automatically. Type BOON for
current targets and HELP DIVINE BOONS for rates, expiry and trade limits.

#0

Epic skill cost
Epic skill cost - Last Edited: 2026-10-19 09:00:00 by Claude
============================================================

Each epic skill is bought from its teacher in steps of 10%, from 0 up to
100. Each step costs epics and platinum, and later steps cost more. Platinum
is rounded up to the nearest whole plat.

First 10% is the cost of the first step, 0 to 10%. Total is the cost of
going from 0 to 100%. Figures are for a character whose class can learn the
skill. If only your secondary class can learn it, epics cost twice as much
and platinum costs three times as much.

Advanced Meditation
  First 10%: 75 epics, 500 plat
  Total:     1650 epics, 11000 plat

Anatomy
  First 10%: 75 epics, 500 plat
  Total:     1650 epics, 11000 plat

Chant Mastery
  First 10%: 225 epics, 1500 plat
  Total:     4950 epics, 33000 plat

Devastating Critical
  First 10%: 225 epics, 1500 plat
  Total:     4950 epics, 33000 plat

Devotion
