#0

Epic skills
Epic skills - Last Edited: 2015-01-22 20:31:43 by ashyel
========================================================
Epic skills can be enhanced through advanced learning. Seek out a special
teacher and pay with epic points and platinum. Type 'epic skills' for the
available skills and their teachers, or 'help <epic skill name>' for details.
Skills can be notched in parts or mastered in one visit if you can pay the
cost. Epic points are spent directly; separate skill points are not used.

Epic skill training begins at level 30. Each skill still requires its usual
eligibility, epic points and platinum. You can earn new epic points at any
level. Stone costs are unchanged.
A more comprehensive list, including names and locations of epic skill teachers, can be found on the DurisMUD wiki at http://duris.wikia.com/wiki/Epic_skills.
==See also==
* Epic skill cost
* Skills
* Racial Skills.

