Ethereal discharge
Ethereal discharge - Last Edited: 2014-09-11 05:40:57 by lohrr
==============================================================
Ethereal discharge is a spell developed by the Star Magus. Being specialized
in the way the energies of the universe works the Star Magus have found a way
to dispel the ethereal and universal energies in a far larger area then any
other dispelling magic ever before.
It is rumored that the spell can match even the conjurations of a conjurer mage
and hit a various number of foes at the same time, dispelling some of their magic.
* --WARNING-- Due to the uncontrolled magic you will lose your own control over
the ethereal energies and thus lose certain abilities when you unleash the
dispelling power.
==See also==
* Star Magus
* Dispel Magic

