#0

Fart
Fart - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
Fart is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Fart, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Fart = You let off a rip-roaring fart!  Clear the room!  Gas explosion!
Fart me/self = The explosive force of your fart sends you airborne for a while.
Fart (target name) = You fart at (target name), sending him flying across the room.
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

