Fire Magus
Fire Magus - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Fire Magus is a Conjurer specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+mDrow Elf&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n, &+WGith&+Gzerai&n, &+RGnome&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+yHalfling&n, &+CHuman&n,
  &+LKobold&n, &+LOrc&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Skill changes==
None beyond the base-class registrations.
==Spell changes==
&+b9th Circle: &+cimmolate, magma burst&n
&+b10th Circle: &+csolar flare, transmute rock to lava&n
==Innate additions==
*&+cprotection from fire&n (obtained at level &+c30&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Conjurer
* Conjurer Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

