Flame Reaver
Flame Reaver - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Flame Reaver is a Reaver specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+mDri&+Lder&n, &+mDrow Elf&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+LOrc&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Skill changes==
&+b30th Level: &+c1h flaying (cap 100%), 1h slashing (cap 95%)&n
&+b53rd Level: &+c2h flaying (cap 100%)&n
==Spell changes==
&+b4th Circle: &+cflameburst&n
&+b5th Circle: &+cburning hands&n
&+b6th Circle: &+cfireshield&n
&+b8th Circle: &+cfireball&n
&+b10th Circle: &+cfirestorm, immolate&n
&+b11th Circle: &+cilienzes flaming sword&n
&+b12th Circle: &+ccegilunes searing blade&n
==Innate additions==
*&+cprotection from fire&n (obtained at level &+c31&n)
 &+cpyrokinesis&n (obtained at level &+c31&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Reaver
* Reaver Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

