Flame strike
Flame strike - Last Edited: 2007-11-20 14:27:00 by zion
=======================================================
* Area of effect: <victim> | <victim> <direction>
* Aggressive:     Yes
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Instantaneous
* Type of spell:  Fire | Divine
"Flame Strike" calls down a column of flames from the sky, striking the
enemy and causing considerable damage. Due to the nature of this spell, one
half of the damage incurred from it is fire based, and one half is Divine, thus
making it effective on creatures who are weak to Divine or Fire based damage.

#0

Flank
Flank - Last Edited: 2009-06-01 18:53:05 by Blaize
==================================================
The eyeless Dreadlords have senses eerily attuned to other than what can be
seen. This gives them the ability to circle around opponents in the heat of
battle, flanking them and attacking from unexpected positions, making it
harder to dodge and parry their vicious attacks and allowing them to cause
even more damage.
You cannot flank someone in a single file room.
	See also:dreadlord ,skilldreadlord

