Follow-Up Riposte
Follow-Up Riposte - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
===============================================================
*Reflexive Skill
Specialized Warriors called Guardians have the additional oppurtunity for an extra
damage riposte. A riposte is a fencing move made when you successfully
parry your opponent's attack and manage to score a hit of your own in
reply. The success of your follow-up riposte depends heavily on your riposte which depends heavily on the success of your
parry.
