Food
Food - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
Food was once essential to survival on Duris but currently
plays a very small part.  Foods are things you can eat, which
can be bought in stores, made through minor created, and
most popularly, fishing.  You can't eat all the time, but
you can eat several times a day.
==See also==
Hunger, fishing, Minor Creation

#0

Forage
Forage - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:11 by Unknown
====================================================
Syntax: forage
"Ingredients" are located throughout the world of Duris, buried under the
ground. In order to retrieve these ingredients, you must "Forage" for them.
Some classes, such as Alchemists and Forest Druids (specialized Druids),
need specific ingredients in order to cast spells or mix potions.
Warning: While foraging, you cannot enter new commands for a period of
time, making you prone to attack. So, be sure you are relatively
safe before foraging!
==See also==
forestdruid, alchemist, ingredients, commands, mix, terrain

