======================================================
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Dependent on proficiency of caster
* Type of spell:  Protection
"Fortitude" increases your ability to live for longer periods of time
while bleeding to death.  This spell will add up to 5 con points and delay the transition from incapacitated to mortally wounded.  It does not prevent such death, however.  If you are not rescued in time, you will still meet your demise.
