Godinroom
Godinroom - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=======================================================
"Inroom" lets you affect an entire room with a command that normally would
only affect one person.
<string> should contain 1 occurrence of ONE of the following:
    %p -all players in the room
    %m -all mobs in the room
    %a -both mobs and players in the room
Example: inroom teleport %p 19617 (Teleports everyone in the room to room
19617).
Example: inroom force %m report (Forces all mobs in the room to report).

