Goose
Goose - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
A proper goosing is a gentle and rather intimate procedure. Simply approach your victim from behind, getting as close to him or her as possible. When the timing is just right, reach your hand around their waist and gentle give their private parts a soft squeeze.
Legend has it that some of the larger races of Duris might require two hands for a successful goosing.
==See also==
seduce, socials, commands

