Greater Earthen Grasp
Greater Earthen Grasp - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
===================================================================
* Area of effect: <room>
* Aggressive:     Yes
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Instantaneous
* Type of spell:  Elemental
"Greater Earthen Grasp" causes many earthen fists to burst from the ground
grasping as many victims as they can, squeezing the life out of them for
serious damage and possible paralysis.

Victims resist the paralysis with saving throws. Greater Earthen Grasp
limits how much the caster's Strength advantage can worsen those saves.
The ordinary Earthen Grasp spell, including the Earth Reaver version,
uses its own unchanged saves. Hold durations are unchanged.
==See also==
* Earthen Grasp
* Minor Paralysis

