=====================================================
A Grifter is a multi-class Bard/Rogue.
Rogues normally do not have any spells, so there is no change to how you acquire/memorize/cast your spells when you multiclass.

#0

Grin
Grin - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
Grin is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Grin, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Grin = You place a wicked grin on your face.
Grin me/self = What's the point?
Grin (target name) = You flash a wicked grin at (target name)
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

#0

Groan
Groan - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
Groan is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Groan at someone, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Groan = You groan loudly.
Groan me/self = You groan loudly at yourself.
Groan (target name) = You groan loudly at (target name)
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

#0

