Grope - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
Grope is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Grope someone, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Grope = Whom do you wish to grope??
Grope me/self = You grope yourself - YUCK.
Grope (target name) = Well, what sort of noise do you expect here?
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

