Group Stone Skin
Group Stone Skin - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==============================================================
* Area of effect: <group>
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Dependent on proficiency of caster
* Type of spell:  Protection
This spell will changes the skin of the casters group to a stone-like consistency and negates almost all damage from physical attacks. It will last until either the duration expires or a variable number of attacks (of any type, whether they hit or do damage) are made against the victim. The number of attacks it protects against varies with level and proficiency of the caster. If a particularily Damaging attack is made, it will provide no protection at all. Group Stone Skin does not block any damage from magical spells (though these attacks will "chip away" at the protection).
==See also==
* Stone Skin
