Guardian
Guardian - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Guardian is a Warrior specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+BBarbarian&n, &+gCen&+Ltaur&n, &+mDri&+Lder&n, &+mDrow Elf&n, &+rDuergar&n, &+yFir&+cbolg&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n, &+WGith&+Gzerai&n,
  &+RGnome&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+yHalfling&n, &+CHuman&n, &+LKobold&n, &+LMino&+rtaur&n, &+YDwarf&n, &+bOgre&n, &+LOrc&n,
  &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n, &+gTroll&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Class mechanics==
Guardians can guard two people at once. The checked-in multi-guard limit is two; server properties can change it. From level 46, rescue <character> all attempts to take that character's attackers and applies six seconds of lag after a successful rescue. Guardian's Bulwark is granted at level 41 and reduces incoming damage while a shield is worn; its checked-in reduction factor is 0.850.
==Skill changes==
&+b30th Level: &+cfollow-up riposte (cap 100%), guard (cap 100%),&n
    &+cshield punch (cap 100%), taunt (cap 90%)&n
&+b41st Level: &+cdreadnaught (cap 100%)&n
&+b46th Level: &+ctriple attack (cap 100%)&n
dual wield: no grant in this specialization
==Spell changes==
None beyond the base-class registrations.
==Innate additions==
*&+cbulwark&n (obtained at level &+c41&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Warrior
* Warrior Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

