Hammer master - Last Edited: 2008-01-26 16:08:25 by zion
========================================================
Hammer mastery is an innate skill among the mountain-dwellers of Duris, the Mountain Dwarves.
The skill is inherited from the thousands of years the mountain dwarves have dwelled inside the
mountains mining and picking away with their hammers. The skill has also been learned by the berserker
as a result of the berserker getting highly satisfied seeing bones and skulls crushed by a hammer or mace.
The very skill itself increases the wielders ability to hit a foe or target greatly with a bludgeoning
weapon.
