Hardcore
Hardcore - Last Edited: 2015-03-27 14:44:11 by gellz
====================================================
When you create a character on Duris you have the option of creating it as Hardcore. These characters are enhanced in most areas such as they do increased damage, have greater resistance to damage and have higher hitpoints than non-hardcore characters. Hardcore characters also do not require the epics as others do to move past level 50, they are able to simply exp right up to level 56. However, there are no 'do-overs' with hardcores.  The character will cease to exist completely after only one death.

