Harpy
Harpy - Last Edited: 2022-10-08 21:12:42 by ashyel
==================================================
Harpies were a race of bird people that came from the
jungle climates of Khomani-Khan. They lived in a
matriarchal system, where the females are usually more
powerful and dangerous. They were quite frail in
physical form, but quite adept at the mystical arts.
Nearly a milennia ago, an unknown plague began to wipe
out and purge the Harpies from existence. The remaining
few that survived pledged to teach on the power of the
Ethermancer to their allies before they as well
succumbed to their fate.
*Agility: Awesome
*Charisma: Average
*Constitution: Average
*Dexterity: Above Average
*Intelligence: Great
*Karma: Average
*Luck: Bad
*Power: Average
*Strength: Bad
*Wisdom: Above Average
==Strength==
Harpies are extremely agile and dexterous creatures with
hearty constitutions.
==Weakness==
Harpies are usually considerably more frail than the average
human, though slightly stronger than elvenkind. Due to their
communion with the forces of wind and cold, Harpies must be
at least resting or even asleep in order to tupor, thereby
making them extremely prone to attack.
==See also==
races, fly, perception, dayvision,tupor, flutter, ultravision
