Healer
Healer - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Healer is a Cleric specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+mDrow Elf&n, &+rDuergar&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n, &+WGith&+Gzerai&n, &+RGnome&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+yHalfling&n,
  &+CHuman&n, &+LKobold&n, &+YDwarf&n, &+LOrc&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Skill changes==
No specialization overrides; ordinary Cleric Kick remains trainable to 40%.
==Spell changes==
&+b6th Circle: &+chealing salve&n
&+b7th Circle: &+cendurance&n
&+b8th Circle: &+cregeneration&n
&+b10th Circle: &+cgroup heal&n
&+b11th Circle: &+cdivine font&n
&+b12th Circle: &+caura of rebirth&n
==Innate additions==
 &+caura_of_spell_protection&n
The magenta Spell Protection aura unlocks when you specialize at level 30.
Healers have no innate ward and cannot receive Improved Healing from Paladins.
Healer-cast healing spells do not gain the Paladin Improved Healing multiplier.
All ordinary Cleric offensive spells and sixth-circle Negative Energy Barrier remain available, with their normal restrictions.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
==See also==
* Cleric
* Cleric Skills
* Specialization
* Unspecialization

