Healing
Healing - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=====================================================
Healing is best accomplished with the aid of a cleric, shaman, or druid.  Without these essential friends, healing can be accomplished by purchasing an "accelerated healing" from the doctor in tharn for a price of 11 platinum.  Healing is also best accomplished in "regeneration rooms" such as the pile of stones in the Rift Valley jungle, or the Fountain at Vellas.  In addition healing goes fastest when in the reclined/rested/sleep position.
==See also==
accelerated healing, recline, Full Heal

