Illusionist
Illusionist - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
Illusions, deception, and shadow magic.

The normal creation menu offers this class only for a permitted race and
alignment.

Equipment follows each item's class/race restrictions and the character's body
slots. There is no blanket permission to equip every item of a weapon or armor
type.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+CHuman&n, &+cGrey Elf&n, &+yHalfling&n, &+RGnome&n, &+WGith&+Gzerai&n, &+mDrow Elf&n, &+LOrc&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n,
  &+GGoblin&n, &+LKobold&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These are normal-roster matrix choices; alignment and server creation switches
still apply. Other forms and event settings may differ.
==Innate abilities==
None.
==Specializations==
* Magician
* Dark Dreamer
Specialization availability also depends on race, level, teacher, and current
specialization/multiclass state. Type specialize to see personal choices.
==See also==
* Illusionist Skills
* Classes
* Specialization
* Multiclass

