#0

Incapacitated
Incapacitated - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===========================================================
When a player or mob is incapacitated they are in a state where they have negative hitpoints (-1 to -10).  Upon being incapacitated, a person will either die instantly or very soon.  Once the hitpoints reach -10, the person will be killed.  Spells such as fortitude can delay death due to incapacitation, and spells such as regeneration and heal can heal those that are incapacitated.  Incapacitated mobs and people are also vulnerable to a nofail backstab, or headbutt.
==See also==
death, backstab, regeneration, accelerated healing, hitpoints, fortitude, headbutt, neckbite

