Ingredients
Ingredients - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:12 by Unknown
=========================================================
Various Ingredients are located throughout the world, buried under the ground. Herbs, Garlic, Nightshade, Mandrake Roots and Dragon's Blood are just a few of the many ingredients that exist. Alchemists require stockpiles of these ingredients in order to Mix their potions. Whereas Forest Druids only require Herbs. You can gather ingredients via the Forage command.
