#0

Inn
Inn - Last Edited: 2008-03-11 19:27:40 by Blaize
================================================
An Inn is a place where a character can immediately quit by renting.
Inns are located in every hometown in Duris.  Often there is a few rooms
to the inn, but only one you can rent. When you return to the game, you
will start off at the same inn.  Inns are a good place to meet a group
of people. At an inn you can have multiple characters logged in for
the purpose of exchanging equipment only.
Warning: Players who have been recently attacked by another player may
have to wait a few minutes before being allowed to rent at an inn.
==See also==
* Camp
* Hometowns
* Idle
* Quit
* Reimbursement
* Rent
* Save

#0

Innate
Innate - Last Edited: 2015-11-07 06:20:34 by lohrr
==================================================
Typing "innate" provides a list of your innate abilities, if any. Innate
abilities are those skills or spells which all members of your race or class
know instinctively. To use an innate ability, use the proper syntax for the
given skill or spell. To get more information on a particular skill or spell,
type "help <skill>" or "help <spell>", respectively. The innate abilities for
each race or class are listed under their help entry.
Note: Many racial and class specific innates only become available at higher
levels.
You can now "innate list player" and "innate list all" to show innates
available to players or all innates in game.
==See also==
Classes
Races

