Instrument
Instrument - Last Edited: 2018-09-20 22:59:56 by lohrr
======================================================
Instruments are a necessity of a bard and needed to create magical affects.
The bard must first be holding the appropriate instrument and then type
"play <songname>".  The various instruments are as follows:  flute, harp,
horn, drums, lyre, mandolin.  Unlike spells, the music played by a bard
is continuous when the bard begins playing and will continue until he/she
ends the song or begins a new song.  Songs do eventually end, of course.
The level of an instrument can be found using 'lore <instrument>'.
==See also==
Play, Songs, Bard, Bard Skills, Unholy Piper, Unholy Piper Skills

#0

Insult
Insult - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
====================================================
Insult is a social command, or an emote. Typing this command will allow you to Insult, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Insult = Sure you don't want to insult everybody?
Insult me = You feel insulted.
Insult (target name) = You insult (target names)
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

