Ioun
Ioun - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
Ioun stones are magical stones that orbit around the wearer"s head when worn.
Each of these mystical stones are one-of-a-kind and thereby artifacts by
nature, but they can be worn with other types of artifacts.  No ioun stone
is alike, and they all bestow different powers.
For a list of iouns, type "arti ioun".
	See also:artifact ,unique ,feeding

#0

Jade Empire
Jade Empire - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
=========================================================
The Jade Empire is a medium sized island located around the Ocean of Seclusion. The capital
city itself is vast and magnificent, often referred as the 'Emerald Jewel'. The city is quite
neutral towards either racewar side, and a small district of the Storm Port navy can be found
on the eastern edge. Rice fields make up much of the western side of the island, and most of
it is marshland. People from all over the world can be found within the Jade capital, visitors
touring the splender of the city. The docks can be found in the northeastern edge of the city
and is an excellent and reknowned port for restocking supplies and shipping cargo.
For players the Jade Empire offers decent experience for levels 20 and up.
Many quests and equipment can be found here as well, suitable for large groups of high level
characters.
==See also==
zones, credits, Storm Port

