Kimordril
Kimordril - Last Edited: 2008-03-14 18:53:15 by Blaize
======================================================
Kimordril is the ancient Dwarven Stronghold located in a mountain region near
Evermeet. The town is filled with many Dwarven warriors who are lead by a great
general. The town does not take too kindly to outsiders and most of those who
run the shops are quite racist.  The town does contain all the amenities one
would expect in a modern city, including an inn, bank and shops.
