==================================================
Kiss is a social command, or an emote. Typeing this command will allow you to Kiss, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of useing these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggors. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
kiss = You blow a soft kiss gently into the air.
kiss me = You kiss the back of your hand... damn, you are good!
kiss (target name) = (target name) gives you a warm and gentle, loving kiss.
