Lag
Lag - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=================================================
Lag refers to the period of time after an action when nothing can be done or when the
mud is responding slow. This occurs after commands such as kick and headbutt or by
actions such as looting a player corpse.
Lag is also a social action to let others know that you aren't performing at top speed.
This is sometimes followed by the spam social due to screens scrolling past once the
lag has cleared.
==See also==
Link Lag, socials, commands, website

