Leech
Leech - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
A leech refers to someone in the group who sits and AFKs the whole time, or someone who does nothing except "steal" the players experience points.  Some leeches are beneficial to the side however, as they play useful characters and just don't want to deal with the tediousness of leveling a new character to 20.  So they join groups or zones and often die, not as frequently as expected though.

