Lich
Lich - Last Edited: 2022-10-08 21:29:28 by ashyel
=================================================
A Lich exists because of its own desires and the use of powerful and arcane
magic. The Lich passes from a state of humanity to a non-living existence
through both force of will, and from employing nearly forgotten and
forbidden forms of necromancy. In life, Liches were ultra powerful
necromancers who, sought to extend their own lives by and means and took
advantage of an unholy opportunity to prolong their lives almost
indefinitely by descending via a transformation from the living to undead.
Appearance:
A Lich can appear as a skeleton at first glance, but they are covered by a
very tight layer of dead and pallid skin.  They are often covered with rotting
but fine garments.  Their eye sockets are black holes with glowing points of
light in the center.
==See also==
* Necromancer
==Class list==
No classes available.
==Racial Statistics==
Strength    : 70
Agility     : 115
Dexterity   : 100
Constitution: 70
Power       : 150
Intelligence: 145
Wisdom      : 100
Charisma    : 90
Luck        : 100
Karma       : 100
==Racial Traits==
Combat Pulse : good
Spell Pulse  : formidable
==Innate abilities==
*ultravision
*spell absorb (obtained at level 21)
*eyeless
*magic resistance
*vulnerable to sun
*protection from cold
*undead fealty
 call of the grave
'*' Designates passive ability.

