Lizardmen
Lizardmen - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:13 by Unknown
=======================================================
The Lizardmen are a small tribe of reptilian monsters that live under the rift jungle.  They can be accessed by falling down a waterfall (owch) and through a section of aggressive piranhas.  The lizardmen themselves are large in size, and are great experience from anyone 20-30.  Leaving lizardmen is however not as easy as getting in.  To leave the lizardmen you must defeat 2 rooms each containing 2 aggressive guards. (watch out they bodyslam).  It is often wise to have a group of 3 or 4 before attempting the lizardmen.
==See also==
Woodseer, zones, exp, search

#0

Lizardmen Caves
Lizardmen Caves - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
=============================================================
==Characteristics==
* Levels: 10-30
==Description==
Located on the southestern edge of the Rift Valley Jungle, the Lizardman Caves is an excellent place for the slightly more experienced player.  Their evil nature again is marked by there glowing (Red Aura).  The lizardmen stand proud and guard there post with supreme skill and dedication.  The hunter will find a wide range of foe in this small pocket of the Rift Valley Jungle.  Many of the good side players will unfortunately find there way to this zone from the river if they sink down to its trap.  From Rift Valley Jungle you must search the room Along a Cliff in the Rift Valley Jungle and open the vines, but be warned, THIS ZONE IS AGGRO GOOD.
* Quest: No
* Hints: Mobs Do Not See Invisibility
==See also==
Rift Valley Jungle, Woodseer, credits, exp

