Luck
Luck - Last Edited: 2008-03-25 20:07:07 by Blaize
=================================================
Luck is the chance of good things happening to you; how much good fortune
or prosperity you may have. The Epic Skills Forage and Craft are augmented
by a high luck stat. All other races and classes benefit from luck as well.
When you have high luck, things will more often go your way.
==See Also==
* Agility
* Attributes
* Charisma
* Constitution
* Dexterity
* Intelligence
* Power
* Strength
* Wisdom

