socials, commands, luck

#0

Lure
Lure - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
To lure is to attack one mob and then fall back to a predetermined spot in order to kill. This is useful when there are multiple mobs in the room that protect eachother or in rooms full of aggressive mobs.
In order to do this successfully it is sometimes wise of the lurer to remove their weapons so as to not riposte additional mobs. If this method does not succeed in drawing out the mob then the other option is to lure with spells. This tactic is commonly refered to as the Immolure or Doomlure; though other spells have shown their effectiveness.
==See also==
Riposte, Immolure, Doomlure,

