The purpose of this encyclopedia is to create a database of information that services the multi-user dungeon Duris. By means of a collective effort, both new and supplementary information will provide users of varying experience with a valuable resource. Users are encouraged to edit/add information that conforms to a neutral point of view (NPOV).
