Massage
Massage - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=====================================================
Massage is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Massage someones shoulders, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Massage = Massage what? - thin air?
Massage me/self = You practice yoga as you try to massage yourself.
Massage (target name) = You gently massage (target name)'s shoulders.
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

