Message
Message - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=====================================================
Leaving a public message in the mud is possible by the use of message boards.  Message boards can be found in almost all hometowns.  Message boards can be also found in Guildhalls, and those messages are specific for the guild only.  Message boards in hometowns are able to be seen by anyone on the same side. (good or evil).  Messages can also be written with the use of a quill and a blank piece of paper.  Both can be created using the 'minor creation spell'.
Also see: Help write

