=======================================================
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive: Yes
* Cumulative: No
* Duration: Instantaneous
* Type of spell:  Fear
Delving into the depths of the foe"s psyche, the Illusionist draws upon
their deepest visions of horror, projecting it forward into seeming reality
in an attempt to cause panic and fear.
==See also==
* Fear
