OT
OT - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
================================================
Outcast tower or OT is a good place to gain some experience.  It has a backdoor just south of the main entry, which can be searched out.  Inside the tower you will need flight or levitation, you can find some of the most amazing creatures.  They range from an alligator nesting grounds to bloodthirsty warbeasts.  On the second level of the tower is all aggressive monsters with decent gear.  Upon reaching the third floor is the most deadly, full of troll guards and a nasty drow sorcerer.  At the top of the tower is a lich illusionist and a nasty energy drain-breathing dragon.  Fun but requires a good group of warriors to tackle.
==See also==
zones, Woodseer, fly, illusionist

