Ogre
Ogre - Last Edited: 2022-10-08 21:41:23 by ashyel
=================================================
Ogres are a race of massive humanoids that are typically
three feet taller and twice as strong as average humans.
Although they are extremely unintelligent and clumsy,
Ogres are fearsome warriors and are feared by all races.
Ogres are evil and ill-tempered creatures, and they tend
to be excessively destructive and have been known to
occasionally eat humans. They live amongst themselves in
clan-fashion and often organize war parties to raid and
pillage.
They have an unparalleled level of stupidity and enhanced
damage versus smaller opponents. The greater the height
difference, the greater the damage modifier.
It should be noted also that because of their bulk,
Ogres are restricted from using arm or leg gear,
and cannot wear full body armor.
==See also==
* Innate
* Races
==Class list==
* Warrior     : Swordsman, Guardian
* Shaman      : Elementalist, Spiritualist, Animalist
==Racial Statistics==
Strength    : 230
Agility     : 65
Dexterity   : 65
Constitution: 200
Power       : 60
Intelligence: 70
Wisdom      : 80
Charisma    : 50
Luck        : 90
Karma       : 100
==Racial Traits==
Combat Pulse : atrociously bad
Spell Pulse  : bad
==Innate abilities==
 doorbash
*ultravision
 bodyslam
 ogre roar (obtained at level 11)
*vulnerable to sun
*magic vulnerability
'*' Designates passive ability.

