Paladin auras - Last Edited: 2008-05-09 20:19:34 by Blaize
==========================================================
Paladins, Anti-Paladins and eligible Clerics can radiate auras to eligible
nearby group members. A provider maintains only one aura at a time;
different providers may radiate different aura types simultaneously.
Identical aura types do not stack. Cleric Healers cannot receive the
Improved Healing bonus or enhance their spells with it.
Syntax: innate <aura_name>
