Port
Port - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
''Port'' or ''Porting'' refers to the action of casting mass transport spells such as etherportal, wormhole, moonwell, or dream travel.
The word port also is used to describe the characteristics of a room. If a room is ''portable'' it means you are able to cast mass transportation spells to and from that room.
Prior to ''porting'' to someone, it is generally expected to inform the target of the incoming port, or to ask them to make sure they are ''portable''.
==See also==
etherportal, wormhole, moonwell, Dream Travel

