Portal
Portal - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
====================================================
A Portal, Well or Rift refers to a gateway created by either a Shaman, Druid, or Psionicist.
These gateways created are a two-way transport system for players to go back and forth.
Note: Portals can only be created in "portable" locations.  These locations can be anywhere on the maps except for the roads, or in most lower leveled areas (except hometowns).  A portable location is often associated with being able to "word of recall" or "teleport"
==See also==
Word of Recall, Teleport, Moonwell, Etherportal, Wormhole, Enter

