Potions
Potions - Last Edited: 2008-03-19 19:59:21 by Blaize
====================================================
A potion is a substance that can be quaffed to give desirable as
well as undesirable affects.  Potions were also once required to
level past level 50, currently one must use epic points to advance
past level 45. These potions were called glowing potions. Many
different types of potions exist from healing, vigorization,
stone skin, haste, flight and invisibility. Potions can sometimes
be further revealed by the spell "reveal true name". Quaffing a
potion is easier to do when not in battle, and quaffing a potion
also has a slight bit of lag accompanied with it.
==See also==
* Epic
* Quaff

