Power
Power - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================
A statistic primarily used by Psionicists. Although, there are spellcasters
who use spells that rely on r. Spells like Power Word Blind are more
detrimental to the victim of the caster has high power.
Likewise, a high power stat provides greater resistance to power based spells.
A high power also lets those who drain life absorb more hit points above
their maximum. Anti-Paladins gain a little extra room, but no one can be
drained above two and a half times their normal maximum hit points, and hit
points above maximum fade gradually.
