#0

Power word kill
Power word kill - Last Edited: 2010-03-19 14:55:35 by Blaize
============================================================
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive:     Yes
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Instantaneous
* Type of spell:  Generic
This spell causes instant death to a victim with less than a certain amount
of lifeforce, with the amount determined by the spellcaster's proficiency.
On victim's with a lot of life force, the spell will fail, and only drain a
small amount of life from the victim.
The spell is not effective against greater races, such as demons, devils, and
dragons. The invocation fails against the undead, as their are already half-
dead.
If the caster is more than 15 levels higher than the victim, the victim has
a very difficult time saving versus instant death.

