Puke
Puke - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
Puke is a social command, or an emote. Typing this command will allow you to Puke, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Puke = You turn green and puke...chunks everywhere!!!
Puke me = You puke all over yourself.
Puke (target name) = You jam your finger down your throat and spew vomit on him
