Quaff
Quaff - Last Edited: 2014-09-30 01:42:08 by ashyel
==================================================
Syntax:  quaff <potion>
Quaff is used to consume a magical potion. Because potions are magical,
they will have no effects if quaffed in a "No Magic" room.  Also, be forewarned! Trying to quaff while in battle may cause you to spill the contents of your bottle instead of consuming them.
