Ready
Ready - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
Ready is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Burp, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Ready = You let everyone know you're ready to go!
Ready me/self = You let yourself know your ready to go!
Ready (target name) = You let (target name) know you are ready to go.
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

