blacksmiths and battle-forgers use these recipes.
Once the ingredients are in your inventory, just type mix.
Lvl. 6: a small flask of nitrogen
Ingredients: a green herb and some garlic
Lvl. 11: a potion of faerie fire
Ingredients: a green herb, some garlic, and some faerie dust
Lvl. 11: a potion of anti-magic
Ingredients: some nightshade, some garlic, and a mandrake root
Lvl. 16: a dark potion of withering
Ingredients: a green herb, some nightshade, and a mandrake root
Lvl. 21: a potion of slooowness
Ingredients: a green herb, some nightshade, some faerie dust, and a few drops of dragons blood
Lvl. 26: a potion of living stone
Ingredients: a strange stone, a mandrake root, some faerie dust, and a few drops of dragons blood
Lvl. 26: a vial of greasy liquid
Ingredients: a green herb, some garlic, a few drops of dragons blood, and some nightshade
Lvl. 31: a potion of feeblemind
Ingredients: a green herb, some nightshade, some faerie dust, and some garlic
Lvl. 31: a flask of incendiary substance
Ingredients: a mandrake root, some nightshade, a few drops of dragons blood, and some garlic
Lvl. 36: a potion of flight
Ingredients: some garlic, a green herb, some faerie dust, a mandrake root, and some nightshade
Lvl. 36: a thick bottle full of explosive
Ingredients: a green herb, some garlic, a few drops of dragons blood, a mandrake root, and some nightshade
Lvl. 41: a mossy potion of entanglement
Ingredients: a human bone, some garlic, a green herb, and a mandrake
root
Lvl. 41: a vial of strong acid
Ingredients: a human bone, some nightshade, a green herb, a few drops of dragons blood, and a strange stone
Lvl. 51: Greater Living Stone
Ingredients: a living stone, a piece of bone, some faerie dust and a few drops of dragons blood
==See also==
mix, alchemist, throwpotion

