When one finds himself in a tightly cramped room, bumping into those
in the way, he may recline to put himself on his ass. Once in this
position, moving will attempt to squirm past others in the room.  It is
impossible to squirm past others who are fighting in these cramped rooms.
While reclined, players regenerate movement points at a slightly higher rate.
