Rift Valley Jungle - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
================================================================
==Characteristics==
* Level 10-30
* Good territory
==Description==
Adventurers who wander off the trade path from Woodseer will quickly find themselves lost in the Rift Valley Jungle.  Pulsing with life, the jungle is home to many exotic animals, some not so friendly.  Quests are plentiful here, but so are dangers.  Beware a fall into the river, the current is swift!  On the north edge of the jungle can be found the Bullywug village.  South there are rumors of a cavern containing a tribe of Lizardmen.  In the deepest part of the jungle can be found a jodani tree housing the Moonhollow elves.
