Riposte
Riposte - Last Edited: 2009-05-02 17:24:07 by Blaize
====================================================
*Reflexive Skill
*Aggressive: Yes
A riposte is a combat maneuver made when you successfully parry your opponent's
attack and manage to score a minor hit of your own in reply. The success of
your riposte depends heavily on the success of your parry.
One of the small hazards of this skill is that it can produce an aggressive
action against a mob that you haven't yet engaged but is attacking you. Such
as a patrol assisting a mob, or a room full of aggressive monsters.
Riposte doesn't work very well against multiple attackers.
==See also==
* Follow-Up Riposte
* Lure
* Parry
* Parrying Daggers

