Robots
Robots - Last Edited: 2017-09-10 21:22:16 by ashyel
===================================================
A robot is a character that is set up to be run fully independent of its user, through triggers or other methods, by another person.  If you can leave your house for an 8 hour shift and your character is still playable, productive, and fully functional for your teammates to control.. it is a bot. You are botting. The person controlling your bot is now essentially multiplaying.  If we think your character is a bot, you likely already KNOW its a bot, and it will be addressed asap. If you are unsure whether or not you are running a bot, check with an admin BEFORE you get caught with it.
==See also==
multiplaying, rules, laws

