Savannah of Sorrow - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
================================================================
The Savannah of Sorrow is home to many types of rare
and exotic animals, a barren desert area that spans around
a large mountain with a small oasis located in the SW
corner. Dangerous pits can be entered at various spots
within the Savannah, leading to dark and dangerous
locations, and rumours of a single, vast pit with a fiery
portal leading to a distant continent have proven
accurate. For players the Savannah can be good mid-level
exp, though the pits themselves can be quite dangerous and
aggressive, especially the final pit which is recommended
for high level players but can reward a number of rare
objects.
