Scratch
Scratch - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=====================================================
Scratch is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Scratch, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Scratch = You scratch an itch.
Scratch me/self = Poor thing, confused and dandruff too?
Scratch (target name) = You scratch (target)'s back.
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

