Sense life
Sense life - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
========================================================
Sense life is a spell allowing you to notice the life aura of hidden creatures or players when entering or looking in a room. The spell is a self-spell only for those who are able to cast it but there are numerous pieces of equipment available to obtain the spell yourself. While being in a room with a hidden creature and having sense life as an active spell you will see this message:
You sense a lifeform nearby.
However, creatures without a life aura will be very hard to see, even for a keen eye, thus the message will change if and only if you are able to spot the aura to:
You barely sense a lifeform nearby.
See also: hide, Song of Revelation

