Shaboath
Shaboath - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:15 by Unknown
======================================================
==Characteristics==
ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½	Levels: 50+
==Creator==
ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½	Timken
==Description==
Aboleth Savants rule this underwater castle on an island between the warring continents. The zone starts with roaming giants in a place by its self.  This land is by far the richest in all of Duris.  Be warned the treasures locked in its towers are not easy to get even for the seasoned players.  Groups must work hard together and be prepared to fight a wide variety of foes. Potions to raise your level to 51 reside here.  Rumors have it that each tower has a powerful item, so powerful that it is truly a treasure and will swing the balance of power within the realms for those who control them.  If you can reach the well room it is a nice place to swap out tired adventures for fresh fighters. The quests and key words for the door for this zone must be known before starting.
==See also==
zones, potions, level, artifacts, epic

