Shady Grove
Shady Grove - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=========================================================
Shady Grove is not merely the hometown of the orcs, it is an evil hub.  Thieves and assassins roam the streets along with shamans practicing who knows what.  Moreover, ogres, drow, trolls, and all races of evil tend to congregate in Shady Grove.  Various shops are available for basic supplies but several dangerous, aggressive mobs will attack without provocation.
