#0

Shapechange
Shapechange - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:15 by Unknown
=========================================================
<br>Syntax:         To list the shapes known:    shapechange
<br>Syntax:         To learn a shape:            shapechange learn <target>
<br>Syntax:         To shapechange:              shapechange <number>
<br>Syntax:         To return to normal:         shapechange me
Druids use this innate ability to change their form. Through careful
research, the Druid is capable of reforming its body into any animal of the same size.
To change into an animal, the druid finds a suitable animal, and while
standing alongside it, types "shapechange learn animal" (replacing animal with
the name of the animal.)  While learning this shape the druid must stay in the
room. Once researched the Druid may shape into this form until he forgets it.
The Druid cannot cast while in this form. As well, if the druid becomes engaged
in battle while shape changed, they may revert into their original form.

