Shift prime
Shift prime - Last Edited: 2026-10-12
========================================================
Syntax: innate shift_prime

Shift from the Astral Plane to a randomly selected available destination
for your race. You must be out of combat and free of PvP adrenaline.
Githyanki, Illithid and Pillithid destinations now include Clavikord,
Bugentolen, Storm Port and Quietus Quay instead of Killing Fields, Drustl,
Crescent Chasm and Kelek. These four choose a room you can enter in the
selected area, excluding private, no-magic, no-teleport, no-gate, hometown,
ocean and groundless rooms. Each usable destination has equal odds.
Other destination sets are unchanged. If no destination is available,
shifting fails without moving you.
