Shiver
Shiver - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
====================================================
Shiver is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Shiver, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Shiver= You shiver.
Shiver me/self = You shiver uncomfortably to yourself.
Shiver (target name) = (target name)  gives you chills up the spine and you shiver.
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

