Sit
Sit - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
=================================================
Sit is a social command, mud command or an emote. Typing this command will allow you to Sit down, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. Sitting allows a player to memorize, sit to avoid knock down effects that only target standing people, or just to take a load off.
