               Small     : 2'+ to 4'
               Medium    : 4'+ to 7'
               Large     : 7'+ to 12'
               Huge      : 12'+ to 25'
               Giant     : 25'+ to 50'
               Gargantuan: 50'+
It has been rumored there are some spells that can change the size of a creature.
==See Also==
* Attribute

