Skill
Skill - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
The command skill will allow you to see a full detailing of what skills are available to you at any given time.  Folloing the skill name a numerical value is assigned to your current skill level.  By using these skills you will notch them and become more proficient at them.
Some skills are notchable only by performing that action (e.g. Mine), while others, like dodge, happen automatically when engaged in melee combat.
Skills in Duris are unique to each class. Help <classname> skills will give you a list of each classes skills and spells.
==See also==
Practice, Classes, skills, commands

