Sleep
Sleep - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:15 by Unknown
===================================================
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive:     Yes
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Dependent on proficiency of caster
* Type of spell:  Enchantment
A successful spellcast will cause the victim to fall magically asleep for a
time. A victim under this spell cannot awaken on their own; they must wait
for the spell to wear off or be awoken by taking damage.
In addition to the spell 'sleep', sleep is also a command
that can be used by any player.  Sleep is a state of resting
during which you cannot enter any commands or move.  Sleeping
will help a player regenerate hitpoints at a faster rate.
==See also==
wake, commands, sit, meditate, hitpoints

