Smelting
Smelting - Last Edited: 2007-04-19 19:17:15 by Unknown
======================================================
Smelting is one of the skills known to the Blacksmith Class. It allows you
to merge two pieces of ore into one larger one. This is helpful in order to
fulfil the material componenent requirements needed to forge various items.
A foundry is required to smelt ore, this can be innately created by any
Blacksmith.
To smelt ore simply follow these steps:
   Create a foundry. (command:  Innate foundry)
   Open the forge.
   Put the ore you wish to smelt into the forge.
   Smelt the ore.
Syntax:  Smelt
See also blacksmith, forge, mine

