#0

Smoke
Smoke - Last Edited: 2016-12-26 12:33:02 by lohrr
=================================================
Syntax:  smoke <herb> <pipe>
  Smoke is used to inhale burning herbs and accrue their benefits.  Because the
herbs are magical, they will have no effects if smoked in a "No Magic" room.
  In order to smoke, you must be holding a pipe in one of your hands and must
have the herb in your inventory.  Herbs are notoriously fickle to heat and
humidity, whilst pipes come in a variety of styles and strengths.  The cheaper
the pipe the quicker it will fail under the pressures of applied heat.
  Smoking is also subject to the weather and various terrains.  Also, certain
races have physical or social reactions to smoking.  Trolls notoriously have
great difficulties in smoking, although it is possible for them under the
proper conditions.
Please Note:
Smoking aggravates the lungs which will cause you to experience a waiting period
before you can smoke again.  This wait time varies from herb to herb.
==See Also==
* Herbs
* Pipes

