#0

Soul disturbance
Soul disturbance - Last Edited: 2009-06-12 18:14:04 by Blaize
=============================================================
Updated: 12Jun09
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive:     Yes
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Instantaneous
* Type of spell:  Spiritual
"Soul Disturbance" causes the victim's soul to be wracked with pain, doing
considerable damage to unguarded souls. But if the victim has no soul, the
spell does nothing. Souls that have a ward reduce the spell's damage.
Soul disturbance is more difficult to shrug than other spells, but not
impossible. The spell can still be shrugged.
==See also==
* Greater Soul Disturbance

