Soul Link
Soul Link - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
=======================================================
* Area of effect: <victim>
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Up to 10 hours, dependent on proficiency of caster
* Type of spell:  Enchantment
This spell links the essences of the caster and the spell"s recipient.
An enhancement of healing in the spell recipient is created by the link.
However, the caster will sacrifice his ability to absorb health while
the link is active.

