Soul Trap
Soul Trap - Last Edited: 2007-04-20 14:02:09 by Unknown
=======================================================
With macabre thirst, the Deathlord thrusts its weapon through the still
warm corpse of its ally"s foe, seeking the very soul of the fallen. Drawing
the essence of the shadow of the being out, it embraces that life-force,
taking the potency for its own.
	See also:deathlord

#0

Soulshield
Soulshield - Last Edited: 2017-02-06 04:08:13 by lohrr
======================================================
* Area of effect: <caster>
* Aggressive:     No
* Cumulative:     No
* Duration:       Dependent on proficiency of caster
* Type of spell:  Protection
"Soulshield" creates an aligned area of power around the caster which
provides protection against dispel good/evil and (un)holy word spells.
"Soulshield" also protects the caster from a small amount of physical
damage from opposite aligned creatures.
Because of the spiritual conviction paladins have for their dieties,
soulshield provides additional protection against magical attacks for
paladin classed characters.
This spell requires an alignment of (-)950.
==See also==
dispelgood, dispelevil, holyword, unholyword, lesser sanctuary, fireshield, coldshield, cleric, paladin

