Spam
Spam - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
==================================================
"Spam" is a term used to describe repetitive or excessive scrolling of
text. "Spamming" other players or Gods with shouts, tells, or actions is
not allowed.

#0

Spank
Spank - Last Edited: 2007-04-22 22:12:53 by Unknown
===================================================
Spank is a social command, or an Emote. Typing this command will allow you to Spank someones bottom, using preprogrammed commands. The benefits of using these commands will allow you in one word to sum up a long phrase, and social commands are sometimes used as triggers. More often they are a nice simple command to express yourself. The command list is as follows.
Spank = Interesting thought, but it needs to be directed somewhere.
Spank me/self = You start slapping your rear end, giggling.
Spank (target name) = You turn (target name)  on your knee and spank him
==See also==
Emote, Social Actions, commands

