#0
Troll
Troll - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
=================================================
Trolls are a massive, predatory race of monstrous humanoids that dwell within
the murky swamps, damp caverns, and festering barrows of Duris. Standing upwards
of nine feet tall with mottled, rubbery greenish-grey skin, long muscular arms,
and razor-sharp claws, trolls are feared across the realm for their insatiable
hunger and fearsome battle prowess. Trolls are an evil-aligned race and hail from
their ancestral stronghold in the marshlands of Ghore.

Trolls are natural brawlers, possessing immense physical strength and constitutional
toughness that allows them to endure grievous punishment. Most terrifying of all is
their legendary biological regeneration: a troll's flesh and sinew knit back together
rapidly during and after battle, allowing them to recover from severe wounds in moments.
Trolls also possess great skill in swamp stealth and grappling, often dragging their
prey into the muck before devouring them.

==Strengths==
Trolls possess incredible strength and a colossal health pool. Their most defining
trait is powerful passive regeneration, which rapidly heals their wounds at all times.
Their thick, rubbery hide provides natural physical damage reduction, and their raw
mass enables devastating doorbash and bodyslam maneuvers. They also possess keen
ultravision and natural swamp sneaking abilities.

==Weakness==
Trolls are severely vulnerable to fire, which prevents their regenerative flesh from
mending properly. They are also vulnerable to direct sunlight and suffer from dayblindness
when outdoors in bright daylight. Their intellectual faculties and spellcasting speeds
are among the lowest of any race.

==See also==
* Innate
* Races
* Regeneration
* Ultravision
* Ghore
* Bodyslam
* Berserker
