#0
Half-Elf
Half-Elf - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
====================================================
Born of the union between humans and elves, half-elves combine the versatility,
ambition, and vigor of humanity with the grace, keen senses, and arcane affinity of
elvenkind. Standing roughly six feet tall with slender yet athletic builds and slightly
tapered ears, half-elves move easily through civilized surface cities and wilderness
colonies alike. Half-elves are a good-aligned race whose primary homeland is the great
metropolis of Tharnadia.

Half-elves are celebrated for their natural charm and adaptability. Possessing the open-
mindedness of humans and the long-lived perspective of elves, they frequently serve as
skilled diplomats, bards, versatile warriors, and swift spellcasters. Their mixed heritage
grants them natural resistance to magic and an agile intellect that shines in combat and
scholarly pursuits.

==Strengths==
Half-elves possess innate magic resistance, reducing the effectiveness of hostile spells
cast against them. They have natural mastery with longswords, keen infravision, and the
Quick Thinking ability which enhances their reaction speed. Their balanced attribute spread
and fast spellcasting pulse make them capable in nearly any discipline.

==Weakness==
Half-elves do not possess the extreme physical brawn of giants or ogres, nor the specialized
intellectual focus of pureblood Grey Elves.

