Illithid
Illithid - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
====================================================
The Illithid, commonly known as Mind Flayers, are one of the most feared and sinister
races in the subterranean depths of Duris. Originating from the dark, alien caverns of
Ixarkon, illithids possess mauve-tinted rubbery skin, bulbous craniums, and four flexible
tentacles surrounding a lamprey-like mouth designed to extract the brains of sentient prey.
Illithids are an intensely evil race driven by cold intellect and supreme psionic arrogance.

Illithids view all other species as lesser cattle to be enslaved, harvested, or mentally
dominated. Their psionic mastery allows them to levitate effortlessly above obstacles and
shift between planes of existence. In battle, an illithid unleashes devastating psionic
blasts that shatter the minds of their foes before consuming their intellect.

==Strengths==
Illithids possess unmatched mental execution speed, boasting the fastest spell and psionic
pulse in the realms. They have immense Power and Intelligence, innate psionic mind blast,
permanent levitation, planar shifting to Astral and Prime planes, and natural magic resistance.

==Weakness==
Illithids are physically frail with low Strength and Constitution. They suffer from severe
dayblindness and sunlight vulnerability on the surface world, and are universally hunted
by all surface races.

