#0
Vampire
Vampire - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
===================================================
Among the most feared of all undead beings is the Vampire. Emerging from the dark crypts
of Ixarkon or created through the forbidden path of descent, vampires are immortal predators
who sustain their unholy existence by draining the blood and lifeforce of the living.
They appear as pale, aristocratic humanoids with piercing fangs, hypnotic eyes, and an aura
of pure predatory malice.

Vampires combine noble charisma with monstrous ferocity. They are exceptionally strong, fast,
and intelligent, wielding dark sorcery and necromantic powers to bend lesser beings to their
will. In combat, their vampiric touch and savage bite steal the vital essence of their foes
to replenish their own health.

==Strengths==
Vampires possess formidable attributes across the board, innate vampiric touch and life-draining
bite, natural magic resistance, swift combat and casting pulses, and access to Sacrilegious Power
at high levels.

==Weakness==
Vampires are severely vulnerable to fire and sunlight. Direct sunlight burns their undead flesh
and weakens their supernatural powers, forcing them to operate primarily in darkness.

