Death Knight
Death Knight - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
========================================================
Death Knights are doom-laden, heavily armored undead champions who march at the vanguard
of evil forces. Resurrected within the obsidian fortress of Ixarkon from the remains of fallen
paladins and warlords, death knights are encased in blackened iron plate that binds their withered,
skeletal forms. Unlike mindless undead, death knights retain their tactical genius and supreme
martial discipline.

Death Knights channel the burning hellfire of the underworld into their martial arts. In combat,
they summon searing firestorms and wrap themselves in shields of unholy flame, annihilating
opponents while absorbing immense physical punishment.

==Strengths==
Death Knights possess great physical strength and durability, innate protection against fire,
and powerful innate firestorm and fireshield spellcasting abilities. They also possess keen
ultravision.

==Weakness==
Death Knights are vulnerable to direct sunlight and possess sluggish spellcasting recovery
compared to dedicated mages.

