Shadow Beast
Shadow Beast - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
========================================================
The Shadow Beast is a sinister, semi-corporeal undead predator created when a powerful
lycanthrope is slain in its beast state and raised into the realm of shadows. Haunting the
darkest corners of Ixarkon, shadow beasts appear as shaggy, dark humanoids surrounded by a
haze of shifting ectoplasm. They are natural stalkers who delight in assassination, theft,
and terrorizing the living.

Shadow Beasts move through the Underdark with absolute silence. Their supernatural nature
allows them to alter their physical size, project deceptive illusory duplicates to confuse
their prey, and strike with lethal burst speed from behind cover.

==Strengths==
Shadow Beasts boast a very fast combat pulse, extraordinary agility and dexterity, high luck,
innate Underdark stealth, and powerful tactical innates including Enlarge, Project Image, and
Strength.

==Weakness==
Shadow Beasts are vulnerable to fire and magical light attacks. They have lower constitution
and mental attributes than other undead lords.

