Storm Giant
Storm Giant - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
=======================================================
Storm Giants are towering, majestic titans of tempest and thunder who dwell among the
highest mountain peaks and stormy ramparts of NaxVaran. Standing upwards of twelve feet tall
with skin like polished bronze and hair reminiscent of dark storm clouds, storm giants are
among the largest and strongest humanoids on Duris. They are good-natured and peaceful by
nature, but terrifying when provoked to war.

Storm Giants command the primal forces of the skies. With a single gesture they can summon
and hurl crackling bolts of lightning at distant enemies, and their immense physical mass
allows them to smash through iron-reinforced gates and doors without effort.

==Strengths==
Storm Giants possess immense Strength and Constitution, granting them a massive health pool
and heavy carrying capacity. They possess innate Doorbash and the ability to throw lightning
bolts, alongside keen infravision.

==Weakness==
Storm Giants have low agility and dexterity, resulting in slow movement and sluggish spell
recovery. Their colossal size makes tight underground corridors awkward to navigate.

