Wight
Wight - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
=================================================
Wights are grim, desiccated undead warriors animated by dark sorcery and eternal malice
against the living. Emerging from ancient tombs and burial barrows to serve the legions of
Ixarkon, wights appear as tall, muscular humanoid corpses with taut, leathery flesh and glowing
red eyes. They are stronger and more disciplined than common zombies or skeletons.

Wights are relentless shock troops on the battlefield. Their unliving flesh is naturally
dense, and with their innate Stone Skin ability they can withstand punishing physical assaults
while delivering crushing bodyslam attacks against enemy ranks.

==Strengths==
Wights possess high Constitution and Strength, giving them exceptional physical durability.
They possess innate Stone Skin to absorb melee damage, powerful bodyslam and doorbash innates,
and keen ultravision.

==Weakness==
Wights are vulnerable to fire damage and suffer from dayblindness under bright sunlight.
They have low intelligence and wisdom.

