Orog
Orog - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
================================================
Orogs, commonly known as Deep Orcs, are a towering, highly disciplined subterranean race
of great-orcs that dwell in the deepest fortresses of the Underdark (hometown Orogs). Considerably
larger, stronger, and smarter than their surface-dwelling kin, Orogs are natural military leaders
who organize deep-orc legions with ruthless tactical efficiency.

Orogs take great pride in their martial craft, forging heavy plate armor and masterwork weapons
in deep magma foundries. In battle, their Warcaller's Fury inspires savage combat frenzy while
their colossal musculature allows them to overpower frontline opponents with ease.

==Strengths==
Orogs possess massive physical Strength (160) and Constitution (170) alongside high agility.
Their Warcaller's Fury innate provides significant combat enhancements, and they possess keen
ultravision for subterranean warfare.

==Weakness==
Orogs suffer from severe dayblindness and sunlight vulnerability on the surface world. They have
low charisma and limited magical power.

