Githzerai
Githzerai - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
=====================================================
Githzerai are an ascetic, highly disciplined planar race who forged monasteries within the
swirling chaos of Limbo. Slender and gaunt with yellow-tinted skin, angular features, and keen,
unblinking eyes, Githzerai dedicate their lives to rigorous mental discipline, martial arts,
and philosophical introspection. They are allied with the forces of good in Tharnadia.

Centuries of eternal warfare against their hated oppressors, the Illithids, and their bitter
planar cousins, the Githyanki, have honed Githzerai into supreme combatants. They wield psionic
levitation and planar shifting with effortless grace, focusing their minds through the ancient
rite of Rrakkma to hunt and slay mind flayers.

==Strengths==
Githzerai possess innate magic resistance, dual dayvision and ultravision, levitation, and planar
shifting to both Prime and Astral planes. Their Rrakkma innate grants focused combat mastery,
and they excel across a vast array of psionic, arcane, and martial classes.

==Weakness==
Githzerai possess balanced physical attributes without the colossal brute strength of giant-kin.

