Kobold
Kobold - Last Edited: 2026-08-25 12:00:00 by duris
==================================================
Kobolds are a small, reptilian humanoid race that inhabits the deep cavern networks and
subterranean tunnels of the Underdark alongside goblins (hometown Goblin Caves). With scaly hides
ranging from reddish-brown to rusty black, small horns, and snout-like jaws, kobolds take fierce
pride in their claimed draconic heritage. Though small in stature, they are exceptionally cunning,
agile, and industrious miners.

Kobolds compensate for their small size with blisteringly fast reflexes and group coordination.
They are natural miners and trap-builders, capable of moving silently through dark tunnels and
using their soothing, calming demeanor to avoid unwanted aggression from dangerous underground
beasts.

==Strengths==
Kobolds boast exceptional combat and spellcasting pulse speeds, ranking among the fastest in
the game. They have high Intelligence, Agility, and Luck, dual dayvision and ultravision, natural
Underdark stealth, innate Calming aura, and mining mastery.

==Weakness==
Kobolds have lower raw Strength and Constitution due to their small size, limiting their maximum
carrying capacity and bash resistance.

