#0

Divine Warding
Divine Warding - Last Edited: 2026-09-13
Cleric circle: 11th
Area of effect: <self>
Aggressive: No
Cumulative: No
Type of spell: Protection

Divine Warding grants the caster all seven base cleric protection spells:
protection from fire, cold, acid, gas, lightning, good, and evil. Each
protection has its normal strength and lasts 11 elapsed minutes. Each can be
dispelled independently. Recasting resets all seven timers without stacking.
This spell only affects the caster. An individual protection cast afterward
replaces that protection's timer with its ordinary level-based duration.

Usage: cast 'divine warding'

See also: Protection from Fire, Protection from Cold, Protection from Evil

#0

Mass Purification
Mass Purification - Last Edited: 2026-09-13
Cleric circle: 12th
Area of effect: <caster and group in room>
Aggressive: No
Cumulative: No
Type of spell: Curing

Mass Purification cleanses the caster and living group members in the same
room of poison, blindness, disease, and contagion, using the normal cure
mechanics. It works on the caster even when ungrouped. It restores no hit
points and grants no lasting immunity. It does not remove curses, plague,
or other ailments outside those handled by these cures.

Usage: cast 'mass purification'

See also: Remove Poison, Cure Blind, Cure Disease

#0

Blood Tithe
Blood Tithe - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
Anti-Paladin circle: 10th (Dark Knight, Demonic Rider)
Area of effect: <caster>
Aggressive: No
Cumulative: No
Type of spell: Enhancement

Blood Tithe pledges the anti-paladin's blood to the wrath of the group. While
it lasts, damage that enemies deal to the caster builds malice, and malice
makes every player groupmate in the same room hit harder with weapons and
spells. The caster does not share in the bonus.

Malice is measured against the caster's maximum hit points. Each hit counts
for at most 5% of maximum hit points, and malice fades by a quarter every
combat round, so only a caster who keeps taking about 15% of maximum hit
points each round holds a full charge. Blows from the caster's own group or
its pets, or from players of the caster's own side, never feed it.

At full charge each groupmate deals 12% more damage. Beyond three groupmates
in the room the bonus shrinks: about 9% with five, 7% with eight and 5% with
fifteen. Against players the bonus is halved.

Blood Tithes do not stack with each other. A groupmate gains only the
strongest one in the room, and a caster with a Blood Tithe gains none from
others. Blood Tithe does combine with the aura of battlelust: a groupmate
under both gains the full benefit of each. The score command shows the bonus
available to eligible groupmates.

Duration: 15 ticks, plus 1 for every 10 points of Devotion.

Usage: cast 'blood tithe'

See also: Holy Sacrifice, Battle Ecstasy, Aura of Battlelust

