#0

Unspecialization
Unspecialization - Last Edited: 2026-10-18
============================================================
At an assigned unspecialization altar, pray altar to remove a current
specialization for 10 epic points. Success clears the specialization, updates
skills, and forgets prepared spells. It does not restore a previous build or
remove a secondary class. The purchase changes memory immediately; normal
character saves persist it.
==See also==
Specialization, Multiclass

