Earth Reaver is a Reaver specialization. Selection requires level 30, an eligible race, an appropriate teacher, no existing specialization or secondary class, and an expired respecialization timer.
==Allowed races==
&+W*&n &+mDri&+Lder&n, &+mDrow Elf&n, &+rDuergar&n, &+GGith&+Wyanki&n, &+GGoblin&n, &+LOrc&n, &+MTie&+cfl&+ming&n
These permissions apply to an existing character; they do not enable a forbidden creation race/class combination. Server event settings can relax the race filter.
==Skill changes==
&+b30th Level: &+c1h bludgeon (cap 100%)&n
&+b53rd Level: &+c2h bludgeon (cap 100%)&n
==Spell changes==
&+b5th Circle: &+cacid blast&n
&+b7th Circle: &+cstone skin&n
&+b8th Circle: &+cearthen grasp&n
&+b10th Circle: &+cacidimmolate&n
&+b11th Circle: &+cgirilals granite hammer&n
&+b12th Circle: &+cileshs smashing fury&n
==Innate additions==
 &+cstone skin&n (obtained at level &+c36&n)
'*' Designates passive ability.
Requirements are registration values, not automatic learning or preparation. Base-class grants remain subject to the listed specialization changes, and abilities retain their own use conditions.
