Warding Faith
Warding Faith - Last Edited: 2026-10-20
============================================================
Warding Faith has been retired. Cleric Healers no longer receive an innate
damage-absorbing ward, passive ward recharge or healing-triggered ward refill.
Other ward effects from spells and equipment are unaffected.

==See also==
Healer, Epic Warding Faith

#0

Aura of Spell Protection
Aura of Spell Protection - Last Edited: 2026-10-21
============================================================
Syntax: innate aura_of_spell_protection
* Area of effect: <eligible nearby group members>
* Aggressive: No
* Cumulative: No
Cleric Healers and Holymen can radiate a magenta Spell Protection aura after
specializing at level 30. The effect improves spell protection based on the
provider's level. Each provider can maintain only one aura at a time.
==See also==
Healer, Holyman, Aura of Protection, Paladin auras

