Epic Warding Faith
Epic Warding Faith - Last Edited: 2026-10-21
============================================================
Epic Warding Faith is retired and can no longer be purchased or trained.
Existing ranks do not provide ward capacity or ward recharge benefits.
==See also==
Warding Faith, Healer

#0

Boon
Boon - Last Edited: 2026-10-23 00:30:00 by Duris
===========================================================================
Syntax: boon [list]

The Gods of Duris offer automatic bonuses. Your old toggle boon setting
is preserved but does not control these benefits. There is no new boon
shop or task-completion reward. Old earned balances remain recorded.

Eight global slots share one rotation. At most one new boon starts at each
fixed UTC hour; startup fills gradually. A vacant slot can stay empty.
There is at most one cargo event and one PvP event at a time. Downtime
skips missed opportunities. Absolute expiry times survive restart.

Zone EXP: 200% of eligible NPC combat base EXP for eight real hours.
Damage, tanking, healing and kill shares qualify in your designated zone.
Quest, resurrection, PvP and other non-combat EXP do not qualify.
Epic zone: +50% eligible epic-stone base payout for eight real hours.
PvP: +50% legitimate nonzero opposing Good/Evil epic awards for four hours.
Normal level, repeat-victim, frag and final reward limits still apply.
The separate 500-epic Spill Blood reward is never increased by this boon.

Good players receive Good-side objectives and PvP against Evil; Evil players
receive Evil-side objectives and PvP against Good. Unaffiliated players can
use global trade boons but receive no fabricated side objectives. EXP and
epic targets exclude every hometown-flagged zone, safe, private, unfinished,
inaccessible and unsuitable content. Targets reflect recent active accounts
and suitable group levels. Selection brackets do not restrict zone entry.

Cargo AND contraband: +25% eligible BASE SALE REVENUE for four real hours.
Buy at the displayed source after this boon starts, then sell at its distinct
destination before expiry. Existing market, Nexus and ship effects remain.
The cap combines both goods: three times the hold capacity of your account's
FIRST qualifying ship for this boon. Larger ships, alts and relogging cannot
reset it. Only proven paid batches qualify. Old stock, source sellbacks,
salvage and transferred/unverifiable goods earn ordinary revenue only.
Partial sales/losses retain only the remaining verified quantity and basis.
A zero-revenue sale consumes goods and allowance but creates no bonus money.

Each Divine contribution adds to the original eligible base, then the final
award rounds down once under normal caps: 100 EXP +20 existing +100 Divine
is 220; 100 epic +10 existing +50 Divine is 160. Purchase 100, base sale 120:
the trade boon adds 30, total 150, profit 50. It is +25% sale, not profit.

Pause stops new spawns; active boons still expire. Resume waits for the next
hour. A reward prepared legitimately before expiry retains its fixed amount
and boon identity and can finish once after expiry. Later awards do not.
Type boon for your applicable targets, time remaining and next opportunity.
See also: EXPERIENCE, EPIC, FRAG, SHIP CARGO, DIVINEBOON

